@startuml
title Feature: Notification Engine & Real-Time Alerts
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
autonumber

participant "External Service\n(Inventory/Orders)" as External
queue "Message Broker\n(RabbitMQ/Redis PubSub)" as Broker
participant "Notification Microservice" as NotifyAPI
participant "Laravel (BFF)" as BFF
participant "Browser (Vue SPA)" as Browser
actor "User / Admin" as User

== Feature 26: Unified Notification Architecture ==

note left of External: Event trigger (e.g. "Order Shipped",\n"Cart Abandoned", "New Document",\n"Product Restocked")
External -> Broker: Publish Domain Event
Broker -> NotifyAPI: Consume Event

NotifyAPI -> NotifyAPI: Resolve Target User(s)
NotifyAPI -> NotifyAPI: Persist Notification to DB
NotifyAPI -> Broker: Publish "App.Notification" Event (Optional for WebSockets)

User -> Browser: Interact with App (Periodic Polling or Socket)

alt WebSocket Push via Laravel Echo (Preferred)
    Browser <-[#green]- BFF: WSS/SSE Push Notification Payload
else Fallback periodic API Polling
    Browser -> BFF: GET /api/notifications/unread
    BFF -> NotifyAPI: Fetch unread alerts for Auth User
    NotifyAPI -> BFF: List of unread alerts
    BFF -> Browser: JSON Alert List
end

Browser -> User: Display Toast Notification / Header Badge
User -> Browser: Clicks on Notification
Browser -> BFF: POST /api/notifications/{id}/read
BFF -> NotifyAPI: Mark as read
BFF -> Browser: Redirect user to deeply linked content\n(e.g., Target Order, Target Product, Target News)

@enduml
